  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Labour Mobility and Remittances</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this investment supported the Pacific Labour Facility. The Pacific Labour Facility facilitated expansion of Pacific labour mobility to Australia supporting improved placement opportunities for Pacific workers. The program aimed to enhance the livelihoods of workers through effective integration (to Australia) and re-integration (on return to home) and improve the understanding of the social and economic impacts of Pacific labour mobility.</narrative>
  </description>
